    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d637">

                <pb facs="0852" n="742" sameAs="frus:frus1928v03/pg742"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">791.003/145: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Persia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-07-06T15:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 6, 1928—3
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>56. Your 67, July 6, 6 a.m. Text as modified is satisfactory. You may sign and
                    exchange notes.<anchor n="56" xml:id="d637-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d637-f1" n="56" xml:id="d637-f1-content">
                <p>The Minister reported in telegram No. 72, July 11: “Notes providing for
                    Provisional Agreement in matters of personal status and family law jurisdiction
                    signed and exchanged today.” (File No. 791.003/147.)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
